  "description": "Everything a Capsule game's logic is written against, and the build targets that turn its authoring tree into assets: the simulation seam and its fixed step, input as named actions, render intent, save documents, tile grids, collision shapes and queries, and the world of scenes, entities, components and the camera, together with the scene document format and its loader. Nothing in it reaches a graphics device, and a scene is assertable headlessly.",
